- README.md: removed 14 duplicate 'Storage Optimization' sections
- .gitignore: removed 14 duplicate 'Audit and diagnostic dumps' blocks, cleaned up
- src/main.py: renamed SKILLORPipeline -> NextepPipeline (backward-compat alias)
