- pyflakes: fixed all warnings (unused imports, shadowed re, f-strings with no placeholders, unused global, dead duplicate methods)
- Branding: replaced all SKILLOR references with MrNextep across src/, scripts/, docs/, workflows, tests
- All 344 tests passing, pyflakes clean
